# QRCodeApp

A simple QR code generator for iOS. No data collection. No tracking. Everything stays on your device.

---

## Privacy Policy

**Last updated: October 11, 2026**
**Contact: ensarigizem1230@gmail.com**

QRCodeApp does not collect, store, or share any personal data.

All QR code generation happens entirely on your device. No information is sent to us or to any third party. The app does not use analytics, advertising, or tracking tools.

If you use the History feature, your generated QR codes are saved only on your device and are not accessible to us. You can delete them at any time by clearing the app data or uninstalling the app.

We do not require any account or login.

If you choose to open a link from a generated QR code, you will leave the app and the privacy policy of your browser or the destination website will apply.

For any questions, contact **ensarigizem1230@gmail.com**.

