### How to generate a QR code

1. Open the app.
2. Type or paste your text or URL in the input field.
3. Choose your options for correction level, size, and custom colors.
4. Tap **Generate QR Code**.

### How to save or share a QR code

After generating, tap the share icon to save to Photos or send to another app.

### How to view history

Tap the **History** tab at the bottom to see previously generated QR codes. Tap any item to view it again.

### Why is the Generate button disabled?

You must enter some text or a URL first.

### Data collection

The app does not collect any data. If you have a question not covered here, email us and we will respond as soon as possible.
